<title>USA: Harris Trust wins $40 mln Davis County, Utah, GOs. [CORRECTED 16:38 GMT]</title>
<headline>Harris Trust wins $40 mln Davis County, Utah, GOs. [CORRECTED 16:38 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects winner from Merrill Lynch &amp; Co. to Harris Trust.)</p>
<p>Harris Trust said it won $40 million Davis County School District, Utah, general obligation bonds, with a true interest cost of 4.90 percent. (Corrects from 4.9352 percent).</p>
